Third-party software
--------------------
The following projects are NOT included in this repository. They are required
for the AWSIM target and must be obtained separately from their authors under
their own terms:

- AWSIM-Labs (simulator):       https://github.com/duongtd23/AWSIM-Labs
- AW-Runtime-Monitor
  (incl. aw_monitor msg/srv):   https://github.com/duongtd23/AW-Runtime-Monitor
- AW-CheckerPy
  (aw_checkerpy.py, *.maude):   https://github.com/duongtd23/AW-CheckerPy
- Autoware:                     https://github.com/autowarefoundation/autoware
- PRISM:                        https://github.com/prismmodelchecker/prism
- Maude:                        https://github.com/maude-lang/Maude

AW_Kinematics_Extractor/ re-implements, in Python, the kinematics and TTC logic
specified in the AW-CheckerPy Maude specifications.
